      "problem": "What are the pivot columns of the matrix $A,$ given by\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 3\\end{aligned}]?\n$$",
